    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0088_2e767887bd3b.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.11319in;height:1.54028in\" /><br />Let position vectors of <math><mi>O</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>C</mi></math> are <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> respectively.<br /><math><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Area of <math><mo>∆</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><m